=== jstack ===
USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  jstack [-l][-e] <pid>
      (to connect to running process)


POSITIONALS (1) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  pid


FLAGS (3) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-l          long listing. Prints additional information about locks
-e          extended listing. Prints additional information about threads
-?, --help  to print this help message
 or -h
 or -help
